 "description": "Highest-volume OPEN Polymarket markets right now \u2014 sorted by trading volume in the chosen window (24hr / 1wk / 1mo / 1yr / all). The \"where is real money going this week\" lens. Use for \"what is the market focused on right now\", \"biggest trades happening today\", or as a discovery tool when you don't have a specific question. Each result has live yes/no prices in [0,1] = implied probability.",
